# MIS-SCOPED COMMIT — recorded, not rewritten
# recorded 2026-09-16T03:41:45Z by FX-EXEC

WHAT: research-repo commit 71c80e1d ("FX-EXEC 更正: 电池窗口外误跑的迟到量按秒重算 = 85 s")
was intended to carry ONE file — my own incident receipt. It carried 18, because I ran
  git add -- <my file> && git commit -F -
with a pathspec on the ADD but NOT on the COMMIT. `git commit` with no pathspec commits the
whole index, and FX-PROD had files staged in this shared checkout at that moment.
FIXPROGRAM §0.7 says "提交显式 pathspec 并核 git show --name-only" — I did the second half
(which is how I caught it) and only half of the first.

